OL,3,GNEWSADelays as section of M25 reopens
OL,4,Afollowing crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency said the carriageway had
OL,7,Freopened in both directions just before
OL,8,F12:00 BST but there were residual
OL,9,Fdelays of 30 mins and 3 miles (4.8km)
OL,10,Fof congestion on the approach.
